<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Jonah</book>
  <para style="h">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jonah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jonah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Topa in Amittai tapa Jonah paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Khuapi lian ahi Nineveh khua ah va pai ta'n a, hi thu va son khe ta'n; a mite bangza in seksol ziam ka heak ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Jonah in Topa a pial thei natu in a kisawlna sangah pai ngawlin a leelam sangah pai hi. Ama Joppa ah pai in, tua munah Spain ngam ah a pai tu teambaw khat mu hi. Teambaw saapna sum a piak zawkciang Topa taw a kikhuala natu mun Spain ngam ah pai tu in teambaw hawlte taw teambaw tungah kaa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in vuipi khat tuipi tungah vasak a, vuipi suangval nasia mama ahikom teambaw a tapthap tu lauhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Teambaw naseamte patau mama ahikom amate khat simin a pathian tung tek ah huna ngenin au uh hi. Tua zawkciang, a lauhuai ngawl zawhiat natu in teambaw vanh puakte tui sungah vawk uh hi. Tua hun sungin Jonah sia a nuai ah tuak a, teambaw sungah lumin mutthip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Teambaw ukpipa in tua munah Jonah a mu ciangin, “Banghangin mu thong ni ziam? Tho in a, hong hu natu in na pathian tungah thungen in. Ama in eite hong mulkimin ih nuntakna hong khoaikhe tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Teambaw naseamte khat le khat tungah, “Hi bang a lauhuai sung hong then sia akua mawna hi tu ziam, lai meetang sawkin zong tawng,” kici uh hi. Amate in a zon uh ciang Jonah min kisawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang ama tungah amate in, “Tua ahile tu in hong son ta'n! Hi thu huvau in akua mawsiat tu hi ziam? Hi lai ah nang bang vawt ni ziam? Koisung ngam pan hong pai ni ziam? Bang minam ni ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kei Hebrew mi khat khi hi,” ci in Jonah in zo hi. “Lei le tuipi a vawt, vantung Pathian, Topa ka bia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jonah in amate tungah, ama sia Topa kung pan a taithap ahi hunlam son thua hi. Teambaw naseamte lau a, ama tungah, “Tuasia a lauhuai ngamtatna hi thong ngawl ziam!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vuipi suangval nasia vaial ahiciang, teambaw hawlte in ama tungah, “Vuipi suangval a thim natu in bang hong law tu khu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jonah in, “Tuipi sungah hong khia tavun, tua hile vuipi suangval thim tu hi. Hi a lauhuai vuipi suangval na taw uh sia keima khialna hang a hina thu he khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuabang a vawt sangin teambaw naseamte in teambaw vaalbo a thet tu hanciamin a tha neiza uh taw hot uh hi. Ahihang vuipi suangval nasia vaial, nasia vaial a, amate koima theng meal ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang amate in Topa biakpui a, “ Topa awng, thu hong ngen ung, hi sia pa ka thisak uh hu in thidaan hong pia heak in! Topa awng, hite theampo ah vaipuak nei ni hi; nangma vawt hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in Jonah toaito in tuipi sungah khiasuk uh a, thakhat thu in vuipi suangval thim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi thu hangin teambaw naseamte in Topa kiita mama in, sangaw biakpiakna khat pia a, ama na a seam tu in kamciam pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa sawl bangin ngasa lian khat in Jonah valh a, ama sia ngasa ngil sungah sun thum le zan thum om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngasa ngilsung tawngh pan Jonah in Topa a Pathian tungah thungen a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka ngim nga laitakin Topa awng, nang kong biakpui a, nong zo hi. Mithi khua a thukna mun panin, hu ngenin ka au a, nong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thukna mun tuipi taw tatak ma, tuite ii hong uumcipna munah kei nong vawksuk a, a thahatna tuihual theampo in kei hong khunel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na omna panin hawlkeak sa in, ka kingaisun a, na Biakinnpi thiangtho mu kik ngei nawn ngawl tu in ka kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui in hong khum a, hong haaksak hi; tuipi in hong khumcip a, tuaciang tuipi tuipaante in ka lu vialcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mualte ii bul, a tawntung a kikhakcip lei kongpite dong ka zuansuk hi. Ahizong Topa ka Pathian awng, nangma in a thukna munte pan, a nungta in nong la kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nuntakna a kiam susuk ka phaw ciang Topa awng, nang tungah thu kong ngen a, na Biakinnpi thiangtho pan nong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zak thei ngawl milim a biate in, nang tungah hong thumaan nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang kei ka hile pokna la kong sak tu hi; sangaw biakpiakna khat kong nei tu a, ka kamciamsa bangin ka seam tu hi. Ngupna in Topa tung pan hong pai ahi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in vaalbo tungah Jonah a luak natu in ngasa tungah thupia a, tuabangin ngasa lua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Jonah khatvei paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua khuapi lian Nineveh ah va pai ta'n a, a mite tungah kong thupiak sa teng thangsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jonah in Topa thu ni in Nineveh khua ah pai a, tua khuapi lian mama ahiciang a kaantan natu in ni thum hai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonah sia khuapi sungah ni khat tangciing a pai zawkciang ama in, “Ni sawmli sungsang Nineveh khua kisiatham tu hi!” ci in thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nineveh khua mite in Pathian ii thupiak um uh hi. Tua ahiciang amate in mi theampo a lianbel pan a nobel dong kisiik kikna lakna in, antan tu le khau-ip puan silh tu in khensat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nineveh kumpipa in hi thu a zaak ciang, a kumpi tokhum pan dingto in, a puantual suut a, khau-ip puan silhin vuttun sungah tosuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Nineveh khua mite tungah thu thansakna khat puak a: “Hi thu in kumpipa le a uliante tung pan thu piak khat ahi hi: kuama in bangma ne ngawl tu hi; mi theampo, khuite le tuute an, ahibuale a tuidawn tu kikhaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi theampo le nganhing theampo in khau-ip puan silh tu hi. Mi simin Pathian tungah nasia takin thungen tu a, ngitlo ngamtatna le a siathuai a tuk a diannate nusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian a thin kheal kik tha tu hi; a thin uukna thaisak tha tu a ih thi buatu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in amate vawt teng mu a; a ngitlo ngamtatna nusia zo hi ci in mu hi. Tua ahikom ama in a thin khealin daan pia tu a ci bangin pia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jonah sia hi thu huvau in lungdam ngawl hetin thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama in thungen a, “ Topa awng, ka inn pan ka din ma in tubang ngengei in ngamta tu ni hi hong ci hi ngawl khi ziam? Tuasia hu in Spain ngam ah ka hi thei za in tai tu hanciam khi hi! Nang in a it thei le a hesuak thei Pathian hi a, thinsau tawntung, cingh tawntung a, thin kheal tu le daan a pia ngawl tu in kinging tawntung ni hi, ci in kong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu in Topa awng hong thisak ta'n. Ka nuntak nial sang thi leng phazaw hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Na thin uuk thei natu in nang bang thu nei ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuapi nisuana sang mun khat ah Jonah pai in to hi. A kibeal thei bukno khat ama atu vawtin, a lim ah to a Nineveh bang tat tu ziam ngakin en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang Jonah ii a nuamzaw in a lim a belh thei natu in Topa Pathian in a kung hing khat potosak hi. Hi a kung hing sia hangin Jonah lungkim mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong a zing ciang khuavak tuungin, Pathian thupiakna taw lung khat in tua a kung hing sia ne a thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nisua zawkciang Pathian in nisuana sang pan vuisa vasak in, nisa in a lu kap a Jonah butthi tu in kithoai hi. Tua ahikom ama thi nuam hi. Ama in, “Ka nuntak nial sang thi leng phazaw hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in ama tungah, “Hi a kung hing huvau in na thin uuk thei natu nang bang thu nei ni ziam?” ci hi. Jonah in, “Thi ngam natu in thin uuk na — ka thin uuk thei natu thu nei leilam khi hi!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah, “Hi a kung hing sia zan khat thu in po a, a zing ciang bo hi; tuasia atu in nang ii sep bangma om ngawl hi, tuaciang nang ii posak hi ngawl hi — tua hi napi tuasia a tu in khuangai thawthong ni hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahile tua khuapi lian Nineveh tungah bangzata in hesuak zaw kan tu khi ziam. Tua son ngawlin tua khuapi sungah mawbaang ngawl patang mealmawl 120,000 vaal le nganhing tam mama zongh om hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
